                "text": "Medicaid is more than a health care program\u2014it\u2019s a lifeline for working families, seniors and children across this country.  \n\nProud to stand with my fellow Democratic Doctors as we continue fighting tooth and nail to protect this vital program from devastating cuts. https://t.co/e2a547Sutn",
