                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I want to give kudos to my colleagues on @EnergyCommerce who have been fighting for the last 24 hours to protect Americans\u2019 health care. \n\nDemocrats stand united in the fight to protect Medicaid from these harmful cuts. https://t.co/T6Y0FNZlDd",
