                "reply_count": 4,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The Republican budget bill failed to pass out of committee because some Republicans thought it didn't cut Medicaid enough.\n\nWhile Republicans argue over how many Americans should be kicked off their health care, I\u2019ll keep fighting to protect Medicaid and ensure families can get the care they need.",
