                "retweet_count": 13,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Nearly 14 million Americans will lose their health care if this gets signed into law.\u00a0\n\nThis bill does not \u201csave\u201d Medicaid. It breaks it. https://t.co/7BdkoPJuCR",
