                "text": "\u201cThis is not a luxury. I do not have my daughter enrolled on Medicaid so we can have fancy things,\u201d Leader said. \u201cI have my daughter enrolled in Medicaid so we can keep her alive.\"\n\nCourtney\u2019s story is a heartbreaking reminder of what\u2019s at stake.\n\nWe must defeat this bill.",
